(  inflated estimates. ) '
(* Contractor Cartels: Network graph analysis exposes single-agency monopolies and ) '
(  bidding syndicates. ) '
(* Zombie Projects: Survival hazard modeling flags stalled works 6 months before ) '
(  physical deadlines lapse. ) '

